"Intro-Woche: Start-Sätze laut Plan.": "Intro week: starting sets according to the plan.",
"Intro-Woche: Start-Sätze laut Plan. Vergleich ist die Intro-Woche des letzten Zyklus, je Satz +{0} Wdh. pro {1} Wochen Abstand.": "Intro week: starting sets according to the plan. The comparison is the intro week of the last cycle, +{0} rep per set for every {1} weeks in between.",
